## Required named-arm notes

### LH-04 Apple Pie

The L’Homme tailoring chassis is protected; green-apple lift and a restrained dry pastry shadow are the only variant axis. The model does not justify increasing 2-acetylpyrazine from its non-air threshold proxy. Test LH‑04 against LH‑01 and a carrier-matched pastry-module omission before any purchase or dose escalation. The successor physical article is the [locked AP-T1 v3 recipe](../RECIPES/LH-04-APPLE-PIE-AP-T1-v3.md): 4,500 µL, 28 rows, minimum direct dose 10 µL, with the formula-specific NYSUPPLY cinnamon working-stock option. Its 2026-08-28 inventory wording was corrected without changing a dose.

### LN-01 Original 2009 Fidelity

This is the La Nuit family control: cardamom ignition, lavender/cedar braid, dry vetiver–coumarin–tonka intimacy. It is a documentary character target, not an authenticated commercial recipe or similarity claim.

### LN-05 Immortelle Nuit

Immortelle is constrained to a honeyed-dry afterglow inside the La Nuit vertical; curry, maple, hay, tobacco, balsamic amber, and gourmand drift are failures. Verify the Immortelle 10% stock basis before physical dosing and use a constant-total immortelle omission arm.

### Raw-stock floor and optional Coumarin control

Every CURRENT-INVENTORY row is at least 10 µL. LN-07 itself needs no new dilution, but its optional pure-Coumarin role control does: prepare 10% w/w from owned neat powder as 1.000 g Coumarin plus 9.000 g TEC, label the mass receipt, and dispense that stock only at 10 µL or more. Do not silently round or invent any other sub-10 µL dose.

## Acceptance boundary

Zero hard pipeline failures means the formulas are computationally executable under the current stock map. It does not establish hedonism, similarity, stability, safety, or release. No official winner is named until the predeclared blinded panel is complete.
